---
/**
 * HomeContent — bilingual homepage body, rendered on both /en and /zh paths.
 * The page-level locale only changes <html lang>, header, and footer strings;
 * the editorial body stays the same bilingual pairing.
 */
import ApproachSection from '@components/ApproachSection.astro';
import UniversityGrid from '@components/UniversityGrid.astro';
import ContactBlock from '@components/ContactBlock.astro';
---
<ApproachSection background="warm">
  <div slot="en">
    <p class="label">Human, an Education Collective</p>
    <h1 class="display">
      We help students think clearly, read closely, and write with purpose.
    </h1>
    <p class="body-lg">
      I'm Nico Jan. Under the Human, banner, I teach English literature,
      writing, and critical thinking to students who want to learn how to
      think, not just what to think. Lessons are one-on-one, online, and
      based out of Vancouver.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <p class="label">人本・共學社</p>
    <h1 class="display">
      陪學生把思緒想清楚、把文本讀進去、把文字寫得有力。
    </h1>
    <p class="body-lg">
      我是 Nico Jan。在「人本・共學社」這個名字之下，我陪學生讀英文文學、學寫作、練批判思考。
      我們練的是怎麼想事情，而不是只記住別人怎麼想。
      一對一，全線上，從溫哥華出發。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection>
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Curiosity first. Answers later.</h2>
    <p>
      When the answer is a click away, the muscle that lets a child wonder is
      the one that atrophies. So we ask first. We get stuck. We revise.
      Real thinking lives in that process, and no machine can do it for you.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>先好奇，再找答案。</h2>
    <p>
      當答案只要一鍵就能查到，學生原本該有的「想」的力氣最容易鬆掉。
      所以我們先問問題，允許自己卡住，然後再修。
      真正的思考，就在這個過程裡發生，沒有機器能替學生做這件事。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection background="surface">
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Progress you can see every week.</h2>
    <p>
      We set long-term goals and small weekly ones, and we keep them on a
      shared Kanban board. Students and parents see what got worked on, what
      moved forward, and what's next. Nothing is a guess.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>每週都看得見的進展。</h2>
    <p>
      我們一起定長期目標，也定每週的小目標，全部攤在共享看板上。
      學生和家長都能清楚看到：這週做了什麼，哪裡往前推了一步，下週做什麼。
      不用猜。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection>
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>We read closely and think out loud.</h2>
    <p>
      We annotate novels, essays, and graphic texts in shared documents, and
      we talk through what we notice. Observations turn into arguments.
      Arguments turn into clear writing.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>我們細讀文本，也把想法說出來。</h2>
    <p>
      小說、散文、圖像文本，我們在共享文件裡一起標註，把「看到什麼」講出來。
      觀察變成論點，論點再變成清楚的文字。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection background="surface">
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Research habits that travel to university.</h2>
    <p>
      Students learn to use academic databases, manage sources, and cite
      responsibly. By the time they apply, they're writing with evidence
      instead of vibes, and the muscle stays with them through first year
      and beyond.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>能帶進大學的研究習慣。</h2>
    <p>
      學生學會用學術資料庫查資料、管理出處、正確引用。
      到了申請大學的時候，他們是用證據寫作，不是憑感覺。
      這個底子會一路跟著他們走到大一，甚至更遠。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection>
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Skills stick when we make things.</h2>
    <p>
      Essays. Presentations. Short talks. We plan them together, revise with
      clear goals, and use each one to build what the next one needs.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>動手做，能力才會扎下來。</h2>
    <p>
      文章、簡報、短講，我們一起規劃，一起依目標修訂，把每一件作品都當成下一件的練習場。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<section class="section section--warm" aria-labelledby="universities-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="universities__layout">
      <div class="universities__copy" lang="en-CA">
        <h2 id="universities-heading">Where students go next.</h2>
        <p>
          Students have gone on to study at these universities, in subjects
          from humanities to engineering to the sciences.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="universities__copy" lang="zh-Hant">
        <h2>學生的下一站。</h2>
        <p>
          以下是部分學生就讀的大學，科系橫跨人文、工程、商學、到各領域理科。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="universities__grid">
      <UniversityGrid />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ContactBlock />

<style>
.universities__layout {
  display: grid;
  gap: var(--space-6);
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
}
@media (min-width: 48rem) {
  .universities__layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-12); }
}
.universities__copy > h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
.universities__grid { margin-top: var(--space-6); }
</style>
